# Place → layout (login, dock/undock, Mod+Shift+o).
# Fields: place|external|layout
#   place     NM connection name or Wi-Fi SSID; * matches anything
#   external  yes = a non-laptop output is connected; no = laptop only
#   layout    ~/.screenlayout/<layout>.sh if that file exists, else autorandr
#             profile of the same name, or "auto" for autorandr --change
#
# New dock (e.g. work): arandr → Layout → Save As ~/.screenlayout/work.sh
# then add the SSID / ethernet name here as  SomeWifi|yes|work

VinjeLarsenNett|yes|home
VinjeLarsenNett|no|laptop
Wired connection 1|yes|home
Wired connection 1|no|laptop
*|yes|auto
*|no|laptop
